#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "UNIX-like {#unix-like}"
msgstr "UNIX-like {#unix-like}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section provides build instructions for UNIX-like systems.\n"
msgstr "Bahagian ini menyediakan arahan binaan untuk sistem UNIX-like.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements}"
msgstr "Keperluan {#requirements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compilation requires the following tools:\n"
"* A Rust compiler: see for example the [guide on installing Qiskit from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source)\n"
"* A C compiler: for example, GCC on Linux and Clang on MacOS. Qiskit's C API is compatible with a compiler conforming to the [C11](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C11_(C_standard_revision)) standard.\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): a tool to create the C header, which you can install with `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"   Running the tool from the command line should be enabled, which might require exporting your `PATH` variable to include `/path/to/.cargo/bin`.\n"
"* Python library installed (Python 3.9+): The Python library is required during dynamic linking. Notice that Python is not used at runtime and the interpreter is never initialized; only some symbols from `libpython` need to be defined. See [this issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/14240) for more details.\n"
"* (GNU) Make: this is optional but is recommended to use automated install processes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Penyusunan memerlukan alat-alat berikut:\n"
"* Pengkompil Rust: lihat contohnya [panduan memasang Qiskit dari sumber](/guides/install-qiskit-source)\n"
"* Pengkompil C: contohnya, GCC di Linux dan Clang di MacOS. C API Qiskit serasi dengan pengkompil yang mematuhi piawaian [C11](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C11_(C_standard_revision)).\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): alat untuk mencipta pengepala C, yang boleh anda pasang dengan `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"   Menjalankan alat dari baris perintah perlu diaktifkan, yang mungkin memerlukan mengeksport pemboleh ubah `PATH` anda untuk menyertakan `/path/to/.cargo/bin`.\n"
"* Pustaka Python dipasang (Python 3.9+): Pustaka Python diperlukan semasa penghubungan dinamik. Perlu diingat bahawa Python tidak digunakan semasa runtime dan penterjemah tidak pernah dimulakan; hanya beberapa simbol dari `libpython` perlu ditakrifkan. Lihat [isu ini](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/14240) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"
"* (GNU) Make: ini pilihan tetapi disyorkan untuk menggunakan proses pemasangan automatik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This code verifies that everything has been installed:\n"
msgstr "Kod ini mengesahkan bahawa semua telah dipasang:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build {#build}"
msgstr "Binaan {#build}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To build the C header and library, you can run the following Make command[^1] in Qiskit root,\n"
msgstr "Untuk membina pengepala C dan pustaka, anda boleh menjalankan arahan Make berikut[^1] di direktori akar Qiskit,\n"

#. type: Link reference
#, no-wrap
msgid "[^1]: If you did not install Make, check the `Makefile` in Qiskit root for the required commands - or simply install Make; it's not too late."
msgstr "[^1]: Jika anda tidak memasang Make, semak `Makefile` di direktori akar Qiskit untuk arahan yang diperlukan - atau pasang sahaja Make; masih belum terlambat.)"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"which will provide the compiled shared library in `dist/c/lib` and the `qiskit.h` header with\n"
"all function declarations in `dist/c/include`. Note that the precise library name depends\n"
"on the platform; for example,`libqiskit.so` on UNIX and `libqiskit.dylib` on MacOS.\n"
"(Note that this step currently emits a lot of warnings, which is expected, and is no cause for alarm. Future versions will remove the warnings.)\n"
msgstr ""
"yang akan menyediakan pustaka kongsi yang telah dikompil di `dist/c/lib` dan pengepala `qiskit.h` dengan semua deklarasi fungsi di `dist/c/include`. Perhatikan bahawa nama pustaka yang tepat bergantung pada platform; contohnya, `libqiskit.so` di UNIX dan `libqiskit.dylib` di MacOS.\n"
"(Perhatikan bahawa langkah ini pada masa ini mengeluarkan banyak amaran, yang dijangka, dan tidak perlu dibimbangkan. Versi masa depan akan menghapuskan amaran tersebut.)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can then compile a C program using the Qiskit C header and library:\n"
msgstr "Anda kemudian boleh mengkompil program C menggunakan pengepala dan pustaka C Qiskit:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To ensure the Qiskit library is found during linking, set the runtime library path to\n"
"include `/path/to/dist/c/lib`. If the Python library is not available per default during dynamic linking,\n"
"this also needs to be added. These commands depend on the platform. On Linux:\n"
msgstr "Untuk memastikan pustaka Qiskit dijumpai semasa penghubungan, tetapkan laluan pustaka runtime untuk menyertakan `/path/to/dist/c/lib`. Jika pustaka Python tidak tersedia secara lalai semasa penghubungan dinamik, ini juga perlu ditambah. Arahan ini bergantung pada platform. Di Linux:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On MacOS:\n"
msgstr "Di MacOS:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatively, you can set the runtime library path during compilation by adding\n"
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, anda boleh menetapkan laluan pustaka runtime semasa penyusunan dengan menambah\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"to the compiler flags.\n"
"In addition, the Python library needs to be available during dynamic linking. In Linux environments\n"
"this is typically the default. \n"
msgstr ""
"pada bendera pengkompil.\n"
"Selain itu, pustaka Python perlu tersedia semasa penghubungan dinamik. Di persekitaran Linux ini biasanya sudah menjadi lalai.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now you can execute the binary:\n"
msgstr "Sekarang anda boleh melaksanakan binari:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "which, if using the example snippet shown previously, should print\n"
msgstr "yang, jika menggunakan petikan contoh yang ditunjukkan sebelum ini, sepatutnya mencetak\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Windows {#windows}"
msgstr "Windows {#windows}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section provides build instructions for Windows systems.\n"
msgstr "Bahagian ini menyediakan arahan binaan untuk sistem Windows.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two independent ways to use the C API on Windows:\n"
msgstr "Terdapat dua cara bebas untuk menggunakan C API pada Windows:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Build Python extension modules** that use the Qiskit C API. Follow Steps 1-5. This path uses the C headers shipped with the `qiskit` Python package and does not require Rust or cbindgen.\n"
msgstr "**Bina modul sambungan Python** yang menggunakan Qiskit C API. Ikuti Langkah 1-5. Laluan ini menggunakan header C yang disertakan bersama pakej Python `qiskit` dan tidak memerlukan Rust atau cbindgen.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Build the standalone C library** to link against from a pure C program, as is done in the [UNIX-like](#unix) section. Complete Step 1, then skip to [Build the standalone library](#build-the-standalone-library), which lists its additional requirements.\n"
msgstr "**Bina pustaka C tersendiri** untuk dipautkan daripada program C tulen, seperti yang dilakukan dalam bahagian [UNIX-like](#unix). Lengkapkan Langkah 1, kemudian langkau ke [Build the standalone library](#build-the-standalone-library), yang menyenaraikan keperluan tambahannya.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements-1}"
msgstr "Keperluan {#requirements-1}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrator rights are required for some steps.\n"
msgstr "Hak pentadbir diperlukan untuk sesetengah langkah.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "5-8 GB free disk space.\n"
msgstr "5-8 GB ruang cakera bebas.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A C compiler: Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC), installed in Step 1.\n"
msgstr "Pengkompil C: Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC), dipasang dalam Langkah 1.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A 64-bit Python installation (3.10 or later), installed in Step 1.\n"
msgstr "Pemasangan Python 64-bit (3.10 atau lebih baharu), dipasang dalam Langkah 1.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum anda bermula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create your workspace.  This should be a short path on a local drive. Do not use OneDrive-synced folders (such as Documents or Desktop), network drives, or paths with spaces or non-ASCII characters. If your user name contains non-English characters, don't put it under your user folder.\n"
msgstr "Buat ruang kerja anda. Ini sepatutnya laluan pendek pada pemacu tempatan. Jangan gunakan folder yang disegerakkan OneDrive (seperti Documents atau Desktop), pemacu rangkaian, atau laluan dengan ruang atau aksara bukan-ASCII. Jika nama pengguna anda mengandungi aksara bukan-Inggeris, jangan letakkannya di bawah folder pengguna anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples of good workspace paths: `C:\\workspace`, `D:\\workspace`, `C:\\Users\\john\\workspace`\n"
msgstr "Contoh laluan ruang kerja yang baik: `C:\\workspace`, `D:\\workspace`, `C:\\Users\\john\\workspace`\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1. Install the prerequisites {#step-1-install-the-prerequisites}"
msgstr "Langkah 1. Pasang prasyarat {#step-1-install-the-prerequisites}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"MSVC Build Tools (C compiler) — install this first\">\n"
"This is a large download (2-5 GB, 10-30 min). Install it first so you know immediately whether your computer is compatible.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"MSVC Build Tools (C compiler) — install this first\">\n"
"Ini adalah muat turun yang besar (2-5 GB, 10-30 minit). Pasang ini dahulu supaya anda tahu serta-merta sama ada komputer anda serasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Requires administrator rights.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Option A — `winget`** \n"
"Open a PowerShell terminal and run the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pilihan A — `winget`** \n"
"Buka terminal PowerShell dan jalankan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The terminal appears frozen while the installer runs.  This is normal and will take 10-30 minutes. Check your taskbar for a \"Visual Studio Installer\" window.\n"
msgstr "Terminal kelihatan seperti terhenti semasa pemasang berjalan. Ini adalah normal dan akan mengambil masa 10-30 minit. Semak bar tugas anda untuk tetingkap \"Visual Studio Installer\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If `winget` is not recognized, update [App Installer](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9nblggh4nns1) from the Microsoft Store, or use Option B.\n"
msgstr "Jika `winget` tidak dikenali, kemas kini [App Installer](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9nblggh4nns1) daripada Microsoft Store, atau gunakan Pilihan B.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Option B — manual download**\n"
"Open the [Visual Studio Build Tools for C++](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/visual-cpp-build-tools/) website and click Download Build Tools.  Run the executable to start the install.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pilihan B — muat turun secara manual**\n"
"Buka laman [Visual Studio Build Tools for C++](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/visual-cpp-build-tools/) dan klik Download Build Tools. Jalankan fail boleh laku untuk memulakan pemasangan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When the Installing Visual Studio window opens, on the Workloads tab, choose \"Desktop development with C++\". See the [Install C and C++ support in Visual Studio](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/vscpp-step-0-installation?view=msvc-170#step-4---choose-workloads) page for further details. \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"VS Code\">\n"
"Download VS Code from the [Visual Studio Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/) site, or run `winget install Microsoft.VisualStudio.Code`. Run the downloaded executable file to install VS Code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila tetingkap Installing Visual Studio dibuka, pada tab Workloads, pilih \"Desktop development with C++\". Lihat halaman [Install C and C++ support in Visual Studio](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/vscpp-step-0-installation?view=msvc-170#step-4---choose-workloads) untuk butiran lanjut. \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"VS Code\">\n"
"Muat turun VS Code daripada laman [Visual Studio Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/), atau jalankan `winget install Microsoft.VisualStudio.Code`. Jalankan fail boleh laku yang dimuat turun untuk memasang VS Code.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After it is installed, continue with these steps:\n"
"1. Open VS Code\n"
"2. Click File → Open Folder, then select your workspace (for example, `C:\\workspace`).\n"
"3. Click Terminal → New terminal to open a PowerShell terminal.\n"
"4. Click the Extensions icon on the left or press Ctrl+Shift+X. In the Extensions window, search for and install `ms-python.python`, `ms-toolsai.jupyter`, and `ms-vscode.cpptools`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selepas ia dipasang, teruskan dengan langkah-langkah berikut:\n"
"1. Buka VS Code\n"
"2. Klik File → Open Folder, kemudian pilih ruang kerja anda (contohnya, `C:\\workspace`).\n"
"3. Klik Terminal → New terminal untuk membuka terminal PowerShell.\n"
"4. Klik ikon Extensions di sebelah kiri atau tekan Ctrl+Shift+X. Dalam tetingkap Extensions, cari dan pasang `ms-python.python`, `ms-toolsai.jupyter`, dan `ms-vscode.cpptools`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the rest of the commands in this guide in the VS Code terminal, unless otherwise instructed. The VS Code terminal defaults to PowerShell, preventing mix-ups with the Windows built-in command window. \n"
msgstr "Jalankan baki arahan dalam panduan ini dalam terminal VS Code, melainkan diarahkan sebaliknya. Terminal VS Code menggunakan PowerShell secara lalai, mengelakkan kekeliruan dengan tetingkap arahan terbina dalam Windows. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set the workspace variable.  For example, if your workspace is called `workspace`, run the following:\n"
msgstr "Tetapkan pembolehubah ruang kerja. Contohnya, jika ruang kerja anda dinamakan `workspace`, jalankan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Python 3.12 (recommended version)\">\n"
"Python 3.12 is recommended because it has the best wheel availability for `qiskit-aer` and other dependencies. 3.10 and 3.11 also work, but 3.13 or later might lack pre-built wheels for some packages.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Python 3.12 (recommended version)\">\n"
"Python 3.12 disyorkan kerana ia mempunyai ketersediaan wheel terbaik untuk `qiskit-aer` dan kebergantungan lain. 3.10 dan 3.11 juga berfungsi, tetapi 3.13 atau lebih baharu mungkin tidak mempunyai wheel pra-binaan untuk sesetengah pakej.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open the VS Code terminal and run the following code to detect a suitable version of Python:\n"
msgstr "Buka terminal VS Code dan jalankan kod berikut untuk mengesan versi Python yang sesuai:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the download didn't work, or you prefer manual download, comment out the code lines that install Python 3.12, then download Python 3.12 from the [Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/) website.  Run the executable to install Python.  Select \"Add Python to PATH\" during the install, then rerun the above snippet to make sure it's being found.\n"
msgstr "Jika muat turun tidak berjaya, atau anda lebih suka muat turun secara manual, komen baris kod yang memasang Python 3.12, kemudian muat turun Python 3.12 daripada laman [Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/). Jalankan fail boleh laku untuk memasang Python. Pilih \"Add Python to PATH\" semasa pemasangan, kemudian jalankan semula petikan di atas untuk memastikan ia dijumpai.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- Do NOT use the Microsoft Store Python because it lacks C headers. If `python` opens the Microsoft Store, disable the alias by going to Windows Settings → Apps → Advanced app settings → App execution aliases.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- JANGAN gunakan Python Microsoft Store kerana ia tidak mempunyai header C. Jika `python` membuka Microsoft Store, matikan alias dengan pergi ke Windows Settings → Apps → Advanced app settings → App execution aliases.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Anaconda users: run `conda deactivate` until the (base) prefix disappears. If it won't go away, open a new terminal in VS Code.\n"
"</Admonition> \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Pengguna Anaconda: jalankan `conda deactivate` sehingga awalan (base) hilang. Jika ia tidak hilang, buka terminal baharu dalam VS Code.\n"
"</Admonition> \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Git (optional)\">\n"
"    Only needed if you clone lab repositories.  Run `winget install Git.Git`.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Git (optional)\">\n"
"    Hanya diperlukan jika anda mengklon repositori makmal. Jalankan `winget install Git.Git`.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2 - Set up the Python virtual environment with Qiskit {#step-2-set-up-the-python-virtual-environment-with-qiskit}"
msgstr "Langkah 2 - Sediakan persekitaran maya Python dengan Qiskit {#step-2-set-up-the-python-virtual-environment-with-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Reset the VS Code terminal\">\n"
"Open the VS Code terminal and reset it:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Reset the VS Code terminal\">\n"
"Buka terminal VS Code dan tetapkan semula:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Create and activate a virtual environment\">\n"
"Allow script execution (once per user), then create the virtual environment:\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Create and activate a virtual environment\">\n"
"Benarkan pelaksanaan skrip (sekali sahaja bagi setiap pengguna), kemudian buat persekitaran maya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If activation shows a red error about \"scripts disabled\", the `Set-ExecutionPolicy` line was not run.  Run it manually, then retry.\n"
msgstr "Jika pengaktifan menunjukkan ralat merah tentang \"scripts disabled\", baris `Set-ExecutionPolicy` tidak dijalankan. Jalankannya secara manual, kemudian cuba semula.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your prompt should now show `(workspace)`. \n"
msgstr "Prompt anda sepatutnya kini menunjukkan `(workspace)`. \n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify:\n"
msgstr "Verify:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Install packages\">\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Install packages\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--prefer-binary` avoids compiling `qiskit-aer` from source. If `qiskit-aer` still fails, try `pip install qiskit-aer --only-binary=:all:` or skip it.  `qiskit-aer` is optional and is only needed for local simulation.\n"
msgstr "`--prefer-binary` mengelakkan pengkompilan `qiskit-aer` daripada sumber. Jika `qiskit-aer` masih gagal, cuba `pip install qiskit-aer --only-binary=:all:` atau langkau ia. `qiskit-aer` adalah pilihan dan hanya diperlukan untuk simulasi tempatan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Do NOT run `pip install --upgrade qiskit` after setup. Upgrading to a new minor version breaks C extensions built against the old one.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3 - Load the MSVC environment {#step-3-load-the-msvc-environment}"
msgstr "Langkah 3 - Muatkan persekitaran MSVC {#step-3-load-the-msvc-environment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the following code in each new Python session (for example, each time you restart a Jupyter kernel). It locates and loads the MSVC developer environment automatically so you don't need the x64 built-in command prompt.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan kod berikut dalam setiap sesi Python baharu (contohnya, setiap kali anda memulakan semula kernel Jupyter). Ia mengesan dan memuatkan persekitaran pembangun MSVC secara automatik supaya anda tidak memerlukan prompt arahan terbina dalam x64.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The example in this documentation builds C extension modules by using `setuptools` with MSVC. Generally, you define `QISKIT_PYTHON_EXTENSION`, include `qiskit.h`, and call `qk_import()` in your init function. Only headers from `qiskit.capi.get_include()` are needed at build time — no library is linked. See [Extend Qiskit in Python with C](/guides/c-extension-for-python) for details.\n"
msgstr "Contoh dalam dokumentasi ini membina modul sambungan C dengan menggunakan `setuptools` dengan MSVC. Secara umumnya, anda mentakrifkan `QISKIT_PYTHON_EXTENSION`, sertakan `qiskit.h`, dan panggil `qk_import()` dalam fungsi init anda. Hanya header daripada `qiskit.capi.get_include()` diperlukan semasa masa binaan — tiada pustaka dipautkan. Lihat [Extend Qiskit in Python with C](/guides/c-extension-for-python) untuk butiran.\n"

